{"en":[{"partOfSpeech":"Adjective","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"Lasting for a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/short\" title=\"short\">short</a> period of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/time\" title=\"time\">time</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt16\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Existing for only <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/one\" title=\"one\">one</a> <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/day\" title=\"day\">day</a>, as with some <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/flower\" title=\"flower\">flowers</a>, <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/insect\" title=\"insect\">insects</a>, and <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/disease\" title=\"disease\">diseases</a>."},{"definition":"<span class=\"usage-label-sense\" about=\"#mwt17\" typeof=\"mw:Transclusion\"></span> Usually dry, but filling with water for brief periods during and after precipitation."}]},{"partOfSpeech":"Noun","language":"English","definitions":[{"definition":"Something which lasts for a <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/short\" title=\"short\">short</a> period of <a rel=\"mw:WikiLink\" href=\"/wiki/time\" title=\"time\">time</a>."}]}]}